  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet inneh&#xe5;ller utveckling av enskilda sektorer i Topola, Serbien: 1. Mejeri 2. Broiler 3. Turism 4. Honung. Implementeringen sker inom ramen f&#xf6;r Opto International, Topola Rural Development Programme.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is aiming at the development of 4 different sectors in Topola, Serbia; 1. Dairy 2. Broiler 3. Tourism 4. Honey. The implementation is within the Opto International, Topola Rural Development Programme.</narrative>
